#: scripts/shiptemplates/light_carriers.lua:26
msgid ""
"The Saipan combines most of the strengths of the frigate class with the "
"capability to carry and launch starfighters. Its weapons compare favorably "
"with other frigate-class ships."
msgstr "The Saipan combines most of the strengths of the frigate class with the capability to carry and launch starfighters. Its weapons compare favourably with other frigate-class ships."

