#: scripts/shiptemplates/light_carriers.lua:108
msgid ""
"The Jump Carrier is a freighter hull, but with a jump drive and energy "
"storage in place of its cargo bay."
msgstr "The Jump Carrier is a freighter hull, but with a jump drive and energy storage in place of its cargo bay."

#: scripts/shiptemplates/light_carriers.lua:110
#: scripts/shiptemplates/light_carriers.lua:142
#: scripts/shiptemplates/light_carriers.lua:184
msgid ""
"It's designed to carry other ships deep into space, up to and including "
"frigate-class hulls, and it accordingly has special docking parameters that "
"allow ships too big to fit in its docking bay to attach themselves to its "
"hull."
msgstr "It's designed to carry other ships deep into space, up to and including frigate-class hulls, and it accordingly has special docking parameters that allow ships too big to fit in its docking bay to attach themselves to its hull."

